WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.770
Hi, welcome back to the Lam Rim,

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.452
and this is Geshe Michael Roach.

00:00:04.452 --> 00:00:08.185
The picture you just saw
is Master Dharmakirti.

00:00:08.185 --> 00:00:11.533
He lived about 1,500 years ago.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.810
He is going to help us prove something.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:18.720
He is a great debater. He
is a great logistician.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.970
He is the master of clear thinking.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:24.110
Nowadays, I don't like to call it logic.

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.490
Everybody hates logic. Logic is boring.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:32.140
But Master Dharmakirti, he was like,

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.970
"Clear thinking. Clear thinking.
Just learn clear thinking.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.940
If you see smoke, there must be fire."

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:42.140
How can we use that to
develop bodhichitta?

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:45.910
We are going to try to develop
a vision of the bodhisattvas.

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:50.910
But to do this method, we
are going to have to prove

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:54.380
that everyone has been our mom.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.220
Let's go to the text. It is called...

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.840
He quotes, Pabongka
Rinpoche, in his Lam Rim,

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:05.350
he quotes a verse by Dharmakirti,

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.962
or he starts quoting him and he says,

00:01:07.962 --> 00:01:09.870
,SKYE BA YONGS SU LEN PA NA,

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:12.197
,'BYUNG RNGUB DBANG PO BLO DAG NI,

00:01:12.197 --> 00:01:14.530
,RANG GI RIGS LA LTOS MED CAN

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.871
SKYE BA YONGS SU LEN PA NA means

00:01:16.871 --> 00:01:20.795
when you take your rebirth,

00:01:20.795 --> 00:01:24.510
BYUNG RNGUB, 'BYUNG means to breathe in,

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:26.260
and RNGUB means to breathe out.

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:31.260
When you do basic meditation
practice of breathing,

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:34.043
watching your breath,
watching ten breaths,

00:01:34.043 --> 00:01:37.118
before you meditate to focus your mind,

00:01:37.118 --> 00:01:38.630
in the Abhidharma Kosha

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.560
this is called DBUGS 'BYUNG RNGUB.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:44.233
So 'BYUNG RNGUB means exhale and inhale.

00:01:44.233 --> 00:01:47.800
DBANG PO means the sense
powers that you are born with:

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:52.582
your eyes, ears, nose,
tongue and your skin.

00:01:52.582 --> 00:01:55.506
BLO DAG NI - and your mind.

00:01:55.506 --> 00:01:57.964
RANG GI RIGS LA LTOS MED CAN

00:01:57.964 --> 00:02:01.120
They are not something

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:05.202
which depends on something
of their own type.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:11.160
Your breathing, the clarity
of your senses and your mind

00:02:12.782 --> 00:02:17.782
are not something which depends
on the same type of thing.

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:21.990
Then he cuts the quotation
from Dharmakirti.

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:26.290
I thought, this is a great quotation,

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:29.683
this is a great teaching.
It is an entire teaching.

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:33.500
And he mentions it, but
he doesn't teach it.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.870
So I thought, why don't we go
learn this particular verse

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:41.483
from Master Dharmakirti,
which is incredibly important

00:02:41.483 --> 00:02:43.790
and incredibly beautiful.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:46.520
I had the honor, 25 years ago

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:50.930
at the monastery, to help a great scholar.

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.970
He is the teacher of my
main scripture teacher.

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:58.108
My main scripture teacher
is Geshe Thubten Rinchen

00:02:58.108 --> 00:03:01.440
from Sera Mey. A great,
great, great scholar,

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:06.026
a great teacher, extraordinary
teacher, who has taught

00:03:06.026 --> 00:03:09.570
many, many, many geshes.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:14.144
His teacher was Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk,

00:03:14.144 --> 00:03:18.033
who did not come out of Tibet

00:03:18.033 --> 00:03:22.500
during the cultural
revolution. He stayed in Tibet.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.130
So we did not know what
was happening with him.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:29.720
But later he was able
to visit the monastery,

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:33.070
and he said, "By the way, I
have a book for you guys."

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.380
And we're like, "What?"

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.150
And he said, "It is
just something I wrote."

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:41.765
And it's like, in English
it would be like 8,000 pages

00:03:41.765 --> 00:03:46.007
that he had written about Dharmakirti,

00:03:46.007 --> 00:03:50.957
about this great, great
debater from 1,500 years ago.

00:03:50.957 --> 00:03:54.020
We looked at it. My
teachers and I looked at it,

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:56.220
and it was unbelievable.

00:03:56.220 --> 00:04:01.020
He explains Dharmakirti's greatest book,

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:04.430
word by word, and I have never
seen anyone who did that.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:08.143
So then, usually if a book is modern,

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:12.338
if it is not a thousand years
old, we kind of look at it,

00:04:12.338 --> 00:04:14.680
in the monastery, and we are like,

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.500
It's okay, that's nice.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.580
But as we checked his book,

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:22.470
we realized it is a great classic.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:25.750
It will stay for a
thousand years, I think.

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:28.203
It is a great, great classic.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:33.840
I actually was allowed to
join the team, his team,

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:38.710
and we produced two volumes.
It was in two large volumes.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:42.330
We typed in the whole text.
He checked the whole text.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:44.030
My responsibility was to put in

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:48.040
the root text of Dharmakirti
at the right places.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.810
So, this book means a lot to me,

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.230
and it is a great, great commentary.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:57.230
Let's go see what Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk,

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:02.580
one of the greatest explainers
of Master Dharmakirti, says

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:06.810
about recognizing people as your mom.

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:09.100
Don't forget that is what
we are trying to prove:

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.210
have people been your mom or not?

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:15.748
So here are the full verses:

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:17.273
,SKYE BA YONGS SU LEN PA NA,

00:05:17.273 --> 00:05:18.673
,'BYUNG RNGUB DBANG PO BLO DAG NI,

00:05:18.673 --> 00:05:20.631
,RANG GI RIGS LA LTOS MED CAN,

00:05:20.631 --> 00:05:22.506
,LUS NYID 'BA ZHIG LAS SKYE MIN,

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.200
I am not going to,

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:28.460
I am just going to read it roughly,

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:32.140
and then, we won't understand
everything, and then

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.600
we are going to go into Geshe
Yeshe Wangchuk's commentary,

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.240
and he is going to make everything clear.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:41.500
The goal is, by the end of this class,

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.300
which is going to be a
little bit long, okay?

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.530
Don't worry.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:48.130
We are going to try to prove that

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.478
the people around you have been your mom.

00:05:50.478 --> 00:05:55.090
That is a great proof, and
that is one of the greatest

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:58.480
classical reasons for logic

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:01.840
is to prove your past and future lives,

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.060
and to prove that everyone
has been your mother.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:09.060
Why do Buddhists study reasoning or logic?

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:13.400
It is to prove things like
everyone has been your mom,

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.670
and then you are going to
treat people differently,

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:19.210
if you realize, if you
can prove to yourself

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:20.680
that they have been your mom.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:24.143
Then you are halfway on the
way to be a bodhisattva.

00:06:24.143 --> 00:06:26.067
SKYE BA YONGS SU LEN PA NA

00:06:26.067 --> 00:06:28.675
means when you take a rebirth.

00:06:28.675 --> 00:06:31.125
BYUNG RNGUB DBANG PO BLO DAG NI

00:06:31.125 --> 00:06:33.933
The breathing in and out,

00:06:33.933 --> 00:06:37.617
the clarity of your sense
powers, your awareness.

00:06:37.617 --> 00:06:40.880
RANG GI RIGS LA LTOS MED CAN

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.110
Something which does not depend

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:45.549
on something that came before them.

00:06:45.549 --> 00:06:47.120
MIN, next line,

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:49.230
they are not something
which does not depend

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:50.859
on what came before them. Unfortunately,

00:06:50.859 --> 00:06:55.708
Pabongka Rinpoche leaves
out that word, purposely.

00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:57.500
LUS NYID 'BA ZHIG LAS SKYE MIN

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.210
They do not just come from your body.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.803
We are going to get the explanation later.

00:07:01.803 --> 00:07:03.978
,HA CANG THAL PHYIR MTSAMS SBYOR BAR,

00:07:03.978 --> 00:07:05.686
,NUS LDAN MTHONG BA GANG DE LA,

00:07:05.686 --> 00:07:07.094
,CI ZHIG YOD 'GYUR GANG MED PA,

00:07:07.094 --> 00:07:09.493
,GANG GIS PHYI NAS MTSAMS SBYOR MED,

00:07:09.493 --> 00:07:10.326
HA CANG THAL PHYIR

00:07:10.326 --> 00:07:11.242
means it is too much,

00:07:11.242 --> 00:07:13.092
logically, it is too much.

00:07:13.092 --> 00:07:14.320
MTSAMS SBYOR BAR

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:16.970
When you make the crossing to a new life.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:19.624
NUS LDAN MTHONG BA GANG DE LA

00:07:19.624 --> 00:07:22.299
You see that your senses
have their own powers.

00:07:22.299 --> 00:07:25.035
CI ZHIG YOD 'GYUR GANG MED PA

00:07:25.035 --> 00:07:27.602
You check what is there. Nothing is there.

00:07:27.602 --> 00:07:29.780
,GANG GIS PHYI NAS MTSAMS SBYOR MED,

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:31.800
What was it that made the crossing

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.771
into your new life from your old life?

00:07:34.771 --> 00:07:37.179
,GANG DU DROD GSHER LA SOGS PA,

00:07:37.179 --> 00:07:38.728
,SKYE BO SKYE BAR MI 'GYUR BA'I,

00:07:38.728 --> 00:07:40.645
,SA SOGS CHA DE 'GA' YANG MED,

00:07:40.645 --> 00:07:43.170
,DE PHYIR THAMS CAD SA BON BDAG,

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.761
GANG DU DROD GSHER LA SOGS PA

00:07:44.761 --> 00:07:47.150
Let us take cases where beings appeared

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:52.150
to be growing from warmth and
liquid and wet and moisture.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.073
SKYE BO SKYE BAR MI 'GYUR BA'I

00:07:55.073 --> 00:07:56.148
If they are not born that way,

00:07:56.148 --> 00:07:58.450
GSA SOGS CHA DE 'GA' YANG MED

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:02.238
then they don't have any
parts of the element of earth.

00:08:02.238 --> 00:08:04.260
DE PHYIR THAMS CAD SA BON BDAG

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:06.810
Therefore, everything consists of seeds.

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:09.180
It does not make sense yet, don't worry,

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:12.154
I just want to get the
root text in your mind.

00:08:12.154 --> 00:08:13.945
,DE PHYIR DBANG SOGS RANG RIGS LA,

00:08:13.945 --> 00:08:15.545
,LTOS PA MED PAR 'BYUNG YIN NA,

00:08:15.545 --> 00:08:17.245
,JI LTAR GCIG NI YONGS 'GYUR BZHIN,

00:08:17.245 --> 00:08:18.628
,KUN 'GYUR KHYAD PAR MED PHYIR RO,

00:08:18.628 --> 00:08:20.903
DE PHYIR DBANG SOGS RANG RIGS LA

00:08:20.903 --> 00:08:25.903
If the sense powers
don't depend on their own

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.311
type of thing before,

00:08:28.311 --> 00:08:31.436
'BYUNG YIN NA, JI LTAR
GCIG NI YONGS 'GYUR BZHIN

00:08:31.436 --> 00:08:32.873
in the way that one happened,

00:08:32.873 --> 00:08:34.514
KUN 'GYUR KHYAD PAR MED PHYIR RO

00:08:34.514 --> 00:08:36.482
Everything would happen the same way.

00:08:36.482 --> 00:08:38.540
,DBANG RNAMS RE RE LA GNOD NA,

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.848
,YID BLO LA GNOD YOD MA YIN,

00:08:40.848 --> 00:08:44.189
,'DI 'GYUR NA NI DE DAG KYANG,

00:08:44.189 --> 00:08:46.464
,'GYUR BA BDAG TU MTHONG BA YIN,

00:08:46.464 --> 00:08:47.897
DBANG RNAMS RE RE LA GNOD NA

00:08:47.897 --> 00:08:52.897
If we heard the idea that there
could be each sense power,

00:08:53.137 --> 00:08:57.390
YID BLO LA GNOD YOD MA YIN

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:02.390
it is not necessarily hurting
the sense of the thoughts.

00:09:03.411 --> 00:09:04.828
'DI 'GYUR NA NI DE DAG KYANG

00:09:04.828 --> 00:09:06.319
If it were that way,

00:09:06.319 --> 00:09:07.977
'GYUR BA BDAG TU MTHONG BA YIN

00:09:07.977 --> 00:09:09.418
you would see them changing as well.

00:09:09.418 --> 00:09:10.800
Do not worry about the meaning,

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:14.267
I am just loading them words in your mind.

00:09:14.267 --> 00:09:16.834
,DE PHYIR BLO GNAS PA YIN RTEN,

00:09:16.834 --> 00:09:18.316
,BLO NYID LA NI BRTEN PA 'GA',

00:09:18.316 --> 00:09:19.866
,DBANG PO RNAMS KYI RGYU YIN PAS,

00:09:19.866 --> 00:09:21.341
,DE PHYIR BLO LAS DBANG PO YIN,

00:09:21.341 --> 00:09:25.250
DE PHYIR BLO GNAS PA YIN RTEN

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:28.057
Therefore, the staying
of the mind is the basis.

00:09:28.057 --> 00:09:30.223
BLO NYID LA NI BRTEN PA 'GA'

00:09:30.223 --> 00:09:32.633
What is it that rests upon the mind?

00:09:32.633 --> 00:09:34.257
DBANG PO RNAMS KYI RGYU YIN PAS

00:09:34.257 --> 00:09:37.663
If the sense powers are the cause,

00:09:37.663 --> 00:09:39.720
DE PHYIR BLO LAS DBANG PO YIN

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:43.004
therefore, the mind is
coming from the sense powers.

00:09:43.004 --> 00:09:44.754
DE 'DRA'I 'PHEN BYED YOD GYUR NA,

00:09:44.754 --> 00:09:46.762
PHYIS KYANG DE 'DRAR 'GYUR BA YIN,

00:09:46.762 --> 00:09:49.280
If the karma that throws these things

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:52.310
into existence is like that,

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:54.030
then later it should be the same.

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:57.430
That is all, that is all
the Dharmakirti says,

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:00.730
and it is completely un-understandable.

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:02.960
You cannot understand it.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:06.435
Now, here comes Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk,

00:10:06.435 --> 00:10:07.284
he is walking into room

00:10:07.284 --> 00:10:10.080
and says, "Don't worry, I am your man,

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.320
I will explain this to you.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:16.560
In fact, I will give you an explanation,

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:20.210
and in every sentence I will
use Dharmakirti's own words."

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:21.980
That is called a @ZHING 'DREL.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:25.820
I will put Dharmakirti's
words inside the sentence,

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.620
and we'll prove that everyone
has been your mother.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.013
Wow, okay, let's do it.

00:10:31.013 --> 00:10:33.688
BYIS PA SKYE MA THAG
PA'I DBUGS 'BYUNG RNGUB

00:10:33.688 --> 00:10:35.602
Now, comes the commentary.

00:10:35.602 --> 00:10:38.227
BYIS PA SKYE MA THAG
PA'I DBUGS 'BYUNG RNGUB

00:10:38.227 --> 00:10:41.750
means look, when children are first born,

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.300
they start breathing.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:46.810
I am thinking of Maitri, which is the son

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:51.803
of two of our friends,
Noor and Seiji Arao.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:56.850
They just had a child. Here
is the baby, beautiful baby,

00:10:56.850 --> 00:11:01.540
and it came out two months
ago, and six weeks ago,

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:05.233
and he started breathing.

00:11:05.233 --> 00:11:06.099
DBANG PO DVANGS PA,

00:11:06.099 --> 00:11:09.320
means his sense powers,
his eyes are alive.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:13.130
You can look at his eyes
and you know he is already,

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.550
maybe he does not see clearly,

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:17.198
but he is already looking at things/

00:11:17.198 --> 00:11:19.032
BLO'I G-YER BAG SOGS CHOS CAN,

00:11:19.032 --> 00:11:24.029
G-YER BAG here means the
tendency, mental tendency.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.083
You can say his mood, the child's mood.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.670
The child has specific moods.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:34.520
When a kid comes out of their mom,

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.460
already, within a few
days, they are breathing,

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:40.300
they have powers, they are looking around,

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:44.460
and mind in the root
text means G-YER BAG CAN.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:48.560
They have an attitude.
Some kids are cranky.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:51.530
Some kids are generous.
Some kids are happy.

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:53.550
I know Veronica had two boys.

00:11:53.550 --> 00:11:56.930
She said one boy was happy all the time.

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:58.860
One boy was crying all the time.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.110
They were not different.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.690
They did not grow up in a different house.

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:03.880
They didn't grow up with different food.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:07.110
They just had this, what do you call it?

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:12.110
This kind of nature or
attitude about them.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.454
What is the other word for that?

00:12:13.454 --> 00:12:14.420
[Student] Personality?

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.050
Personality, different personalities.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.430
That is called G-YER BAG CAN.

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:21.300
They have different
personalities, from the beginning.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:26.250
So then, he says, these things:

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:31.243
the life in the being, the
breathing which indicates life,

00:12:32.664 --> 00:12:35.980
the sensory awareness and the personality,

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:37.937
which is the mind, right?

00:12:37.937 --> 00:12:40.112
SKYE BA YONGS SU LEN
PA NA RANG GI RIGS 'DRA

00:12:40.112 --> 00:12:41.786
Now, I am going to follow the root text.

00:12:41.786 --> 00:12:43.490
I have underlined the root text,

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:47.080
so you can see how Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:50.500
mixed the root text into his
sentence, very beautiful.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:54.593
He did not make any miss any words.

00:12:54.593 --> 00:12:56.093
SKYE BA YONGS SU LEN PA NA

00:12:56.093 --> 00:12:57.877
When that child takes birth,

00:12:57.877 --> 00:13:02.877
RANG GI RIGS 'DRA SNGA MA
LA BLTOS MED CAN MA YIN

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:05.580
those beautiful eyes,

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:09.770
that life expressed in
breathing, and that personality

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.760
that he is already
showing, and by the way,

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:15.580
Maitri is kind of very happy, friendly,

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.738
his main personality is hungry.

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:20.513
Like Geshe Michael, no.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:26.050
But these are not something
which came out of nowhere:

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:31.050
his breathing, his life, and
his bright eyes looking around,

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:35.120
and his own smile, happy personality,

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.093
they must be like smoke and fire.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.310
They must be like smoke and fire.

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:46.640
His personality, the
brightness of his eyes,

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:50.220
and the fact that he is
alive are like smoke.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:54.130
They are signs of something
that happened before.

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:56.840
When you see smoke, you see fire.

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:59.220
When you see awareness,

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.260
it must have come from something similar.

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:04.363
That's all, that's all where we are at.

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:10.420
Maitri's eyes are like smoke,
something that happened

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:14.490
before he came out and
his mom, is like fire.

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:18.600
We cannot see the fire. That
was all happening inside.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.880
But we can see the smoke.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:24.859
So can we make some
conclusions from the smoke?

00:14:24.859 --> 00:14:26.635
That is all.

00:14:26.635 --> 00:14:28.010
DBUGS 'BYUNG RNGUB DANG,

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.792
DBANG PO DVANGS PA, BLO'I G-YER

00:14:29.792 --> 00:14:32.134
BAG SOGS DANG LDAN PA'I PHYIR

00:14:32.134 --> 00:14:35.716
He is breathing, he has
bright sense powers,

00:14:35.716 --> 00:14:38.813
and his mind has a certain
kind of personality.

00:14:39.786 --> 00:14:43.330
'BYUNG BA'I LUS NYID 'BA'
ZHIG LAS SKYE BA MIN TE

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:46.730
Did the brightness of Maitri's eyes

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:49.960
and the life expressed in his breathing,

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:54.413
and his personality, did
they only come from his skin?

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:00.100
Did those three things come from his skin?

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:02.100
Is that where they came from?

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:05.110
His personality came from his skin?

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:09.230
And his bright eyes and
awareness of the world

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.250
came from his skin?

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:16.250
And his breathing, his
life itself, does it?

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:21.290
Is it some result of his skin?

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:24.830
When you look at his
eyes, and his personality,

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.590
and his awareness, like smoke,

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:30.350
and you try to guess what was the fire,

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:33.700
is the cause of those
three things his skin?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.015
Only his skin, you see?

00:15:36.015 --> 00:15:38.510
'BYUNG BA'I LUS NYID 'BA'
ZHIG LAS SKYE BA MIN TE

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:43.510
No, Dharmakirti says, Geshe
Yeshe Wangchuk says no.

00:15:43.666 --> 00:15:46.100
RIGS 'DRA SNGA MA LAS SKYES PA'I PHYIR

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:49.893
Things are always coming from
other things of the same type.

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:54.630
Things always come from other
things of the same type.

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:58.593
You do not get awareness from skin.

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:02.580
You get awareness from awareness.

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:07.580
You get personality from
the personality before.

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:13.260
You get sense awareness
from sense awareness.

00:16:13.459 --> 00:16:14.800
RANG GI RIGS CAN

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.267
means when you are looking for the cause

00:16:17.267 --> 00:16:20.990
of something, you look
for something similar.

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:22.900
Awareness should come from awareness.

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:25.180
Sensation should come from sensation.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:28.820
Personality should come from personality.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:33.820
Not that they all come from
your skin. That's Dharmakirti.

00:16:34.338 --> 00:16:36.254
RIGS 'DRA SNGA MA LAS SKYES PA'I PHYIR,

00:16:36.254 --> 00:16:38.580
DE LTA MIN NA HA CANG THAL

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:41.310
If you say all that
stuff came from his skin,

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:44.053
that is all, come on, that is BS.

00:16:44.053 --> 00:16:46.919
HA CANG THAL means too much, too much.

00:16:46.919 --> 00:16:48.535
Who said that?

00:16:48.535 --> 00:16:49.466
Dharmakirti.

00:16:49.466 --> 00:16:52.820
HA CANG THAL BA means
come on. Get real, man.

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.870
It means get real, man.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:59.802
Come on. Get real. What
really happened here?

00:16:59.802 --> 00:17:03.303
'BYUNG BA KUN SROG CHAGS SU THAL

00:17:03.303 --> 00:17:04.820
Then all the skin in the world,

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:06.710
and all the chemicals in the skin:

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:09.550
the carbon, and the
oxygen, and the nitrogen,

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:13.050
they must all be babies. There
must be babies everywhere.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:16.418
Everywhere there is oxygen,
everywhere there is carbon,

00:17:16.418 --> 00:17:18.110
everywhere there is nitrogen,

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:19.943
Poof! Oh, there is another Maitri.

00:17:19.943 --> 00:17:22.367
Poof! Oh, there is another Maitri.

00:17:22.367 --> 00:17:24.360
Does it come from your skin?

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.550
Does it come from the chemicals?

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:27.690
Yes, you can show the chemicals.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:29.863
Does it come from your chemicals?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.863
Does Maitri's awareness
and Maitri's friendliness,

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:37.043
does it come from chemicals?

00:17:37.043 --> 00:17:38.910
Okay, you are right.

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.943
Then, anytime you have that
chemical, you have a smile.

00:17:41.943 --> 00:17:43.200
Right?

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.823
That must be.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.750
Why do the chemicals
sometimes make a smile

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.725
and why the same chemical
does not make a smile?

00:17:50.725 --> 00:17:51.744
YIN PAR THAL

00:17:51.744 --> 00:17:55.820
YID BLO 'BYUNG BA 'BA'
ZHIG LAS SKYE BA'I PHYIR

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:59.370
Because according to you,
YID BLO means the mind,

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:01.678
that awareness of the child,

00:18:01.678 --> 00:18:02.661
comes from the 'BYUNG BA.

00:18:02.661 --> 00:18:05.763
Here 'BYUNG BA means the four elements:

00:18:07.371 --> 00:18:09.000
SA CHU ME RLUNG

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:14.000
earth, water, fire, and wind,
which is the Tibetan way

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:19.963
of saying chemicals: carbon,
nitrogen, oxygen, etcetera.

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.900
Then, everywhere you have chemicals

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:25.060
you must have Maitri popping out.

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:25.893
Why?

00:18:25.893 --> 00:18:27.900
Because Maitri just came from chemicals.

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:29.833
His personality came from chemicals.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.261
All kids must be as friendly as Maitri

00:18:33.261 --> 00:18:35.886
because all kids have carbon.

00:18:37.133 --> 00:18:39.200
YIN PAR THAL

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.348
SKYES MA THAG PA'I RIG PA
RANG GI RIGS 'DRA SNGA MA LAS

00:18:41.348 --> 00:18:44.822
PHYI MA MTSAMS SBYOR BAR NUS
PA DANG LDAN PA MTHONG BA DE LA

00:18:45.989 --> 00:18:48.289
SKYES MA THAG PA'I RIG PA

00:18:48.289 --> 00:18:50.270
When you look at the
awareness of the child

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.328
who is just born,

00:18:51.328 --> 00:18:53.827
RANG GI RIGS 'DRA SNGA MA LAS

00:18:53.827 --> 00:18:56.890
PHYI MAMTSAMS SBYOR BAR NUS PA

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:59.800
There must have been some ability

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:03.120
in the cause of Maitri's friendliness

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.540
that created Maitri's friendliness, right?

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:06.880
When Maitri was friendly,

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:09.770
after he came out of his mom, Noor,

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:14.006
then, there must have been
some friendliness before that.

00:19:14.006 --> 00:19:16.022
NUS PA DANG LDAN PA MTHONG BA DE LA

00:19:16.022 --> 00:19:16.864
You can see that.

00:19:16.864 --> 00:19:19.822
RGYU LHAG PO CI ZHIG KYANG
YOD PAR GYUR PA MI DGOS PA

00:19:19.822 --> 00:19:21.804
GANG GI PHYIR NA, PHYI NAS KYANG

00:19:21.804 --> 00:19:24.001
RIG PA PHYI MAR MTSAMS
SBYOR BA MED PA MA YIN NO

00:19:24.001 --> 00:19:27.630
It is not the case that
Maitri died five minutes

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:32.630
after he was born. The
mind that was friendly,

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.763
just after he came out,
continues to be friendly.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:42.340
The friendly mind of Maitri
when he is three years old

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:44.820
is a sign that Maitri had a friendly mind

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:46.490
when he was one year old.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:49.710
And that is a sign of something before.

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:53.033
When you see a kid who
is friendly by nature,

00:19:53.033 --> 00:19:57.070
G-YER BAG CAN, personality,
at three years old,

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.900
then you can think there
must have been some seeds

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:01.680
for that in his mind
when he was one year old.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.630
But who put the seeds in his
mind when he was one year old.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:09.095
You have to think it came
from something similar.

00:20:09.095 --> 00:20:11.611
GANG DU DROD GSHER LAS SKYES
PA LA SOGS PA SKYE BO SKYE BAR

00:20:11.611 --> 00:20:13.211
MI'GYUR BA'I SA SOGS 'BYUNG BA'I

00:20:13.211 --> 00:20:16.002
CHA DE 'GA' YANG MED PA DE'I PHYIR

00:20:16.002 --> 00:20:21.002
According to you, then,
every time you see,

00:20:21.685 --> 00:20:23.387
'BYUNG BA'I DE

00:20:23.387 --> 00:20:25.146
CHA DE 'GA' YANG MED PA DE'I PHYIR,

00:20:25.146 --> 00:20:26.961
'BYUNG BA THAMS CAD SROG CHAGS KYI

00:20:26.961 --> 00:20:28.744
SA BON GYI BDAG NYID CAN DU 'GYUR RO,

00:20:28.744 --> 00:20:32.027
Then of course, any time there is life,

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:35.080
anytime there are chemicals, then,

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.880
then that should produce
Maitri's friendliness.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:41.770
If Maitri's friendliness is
just coming from his skin,

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:45.590
or the chemicals in his body,
and if that is the cause

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:48.080
that turned into his friendliness,

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.110
in the way that his
one-year-old friendliness

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:52.770
turned into his
three-year-old friendliness,

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:57.430
then it must be that chemicals
can produce friendliness,

00:20:57.430 --> 00:20:59.090
and that means you can make friendliness

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:02.260
in a laboratory with the
right chemicals, right?

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:03.880
I guess the bottles of chemicals

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:06.131
will be friendly or something.

00:21:06.131 --> 00:21:07.803
DE LTAR NA HA CANG THAL BA'O

00:21:07.803 --> 00:21:09.700
And that is a little bit too much,

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:12.230
excuse me, HA CANG THAL BA'O.

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:14.697
Come on, that is too much.

00:21:14.697 --> 00:21:17.462
DBANG PO RNAMS RE RE LA GNOD PA YOD NA'ANG

00:21:17.462 --> 00:21:19.970
YID BLO RTOG PA LA GNOD
PA YOD PAS MA KHYAB LA

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:23.286
YID BLO RTOG PA LA MYA NGAN
SOGS KYIS KYIS GNOD NAS

00:21:23.286 --> 00:21:25.844
'GYUR NA DBANG PO DE DAG
KYANG 'GYUR BA DAG TU

00:21:25.844 --> 00:21:26.720
MTHONG BA YIN PA'I PHYIR

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:30.617
What is the relationship
between the sense powers

00:21:30.617 --> 00:21:33.830
and Maitri's state of mind?

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:38.020
What is the relationship
between his physical eye,

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:40.650
his physical ear, his physical nose,

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.900
and how he is feeling, his personality?

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:46.840
What is the relationship between his nose

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:48.542
and his personality?

00:21:48.542 --> 00:21:51.275
DBANG PO RNAMS RE RE LA GNOD PA YOD NA'ANG

00:21:51.275 --> 00:21:56.275
Look, you can hurt the nose
and the mind can stay friendly.

00:21:56.630 --> 00:22:01.630
It is possible. I had a
friend, we saw her last night,

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:04.730
Kayla, her daughter. Did you know?

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:06.763
Her daughter was bitten badly by a dog,

00:22:07.600 --> 00:22:11.423
and part of her nose was cut very badly.

00:22:11.423 --> 00:22:14.350
But the child is very sweet.

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:19.350
It means, if Maitri's skin was creating

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:24.858
Maitri's personality, then
when you cut the skin,

00:22:24.858 --> 00:22:28.144
Maitri's personality should
get mean. But it does not.

00:22:28.144 --> 00:22:30.540
That indicates that maybe the skin

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:33.848
is not the cause of Maitri's
personality. Got it?

00:22:33.848 --> 00:22:35.800
You can hurt the skin,
but you do not necessarily

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:37.437
change the personality. But,

00:22:37.437 --> 00:22:42.369
YID BLO RTOG PA LA MYA NGAN
SOGS KYIS GNOD NAS 'GYUR NA

00:22:42.369 --> 00:22:47.230
But if you hurt the mind,
it tends to hurt the body.

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:50.767
If a person's depressed for a long period,

00:22:50.767 --> 00:22:52.710
usually their health will suffer,

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:54.487
usually their physical
health will get worse.

00:22:54.487 --> 00:22:58.040
So it is not the case
that the physical body

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:00.260
determines the state of the mind,

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:02.470
but it seems that the state of the mind

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:04.930
can affect the health
of the physical body.

00:23:04.930 --> 00:23:07.688
Like that, he wants to go to this way.

00:23:07.688 --> 00:23:09.027
MTHONG BA YIN PA'I PHYIR,

00:23:09.027 --> 00:23:11.868
YID BLO RTOG PA DE'I RTEN
KHYAD PAR CAN GANG ZHIG NA,

00:23:11.868 --> 00:23:14.352
RANG GI RIGS MTHUN BLO
SNGA MA NYID LA BRTEN PA'I

00:23:14.352 --> 00:23:17.659
SNGON GYI SEMS PA'I LAS 'GA'
ZHIG DA LTAR YID BLO GNAS PA'I

00:23:17.659 --> 00:23:19.950
RTEN YIN PA DE'I PHYIR,

00:23:19.950 --> 00:23:23.020
YID BLO RTOG PA RTEN MED PA MA YIN NO,

00:23:23.020 --> 00:23:28.003
So is it the case that
Maitri's personality

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:31.340
is without a basis?

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:34.270
In Buddhism, we say...
This is called BRTEN.

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:36.220
this is called RTEN.

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:39.450
And the handkerchief
is holding up the cup.

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:42.360
So this is called the
basis, the foundation.

00:23:42.360 --> 00:23:46.090
And this is called what is
resting on the foundation.

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:50.930
This is Maitri's current
personality, that he is friendly.

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:54.770
It must be resting on
something in the past.

00:23:54.770 --> 00:23:57.400
Something about his mind in the past

00:23:57.400 --> 00:24:02.400
made his current mind friendly,
and this past state of mind

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:05.480
is holding up his current state of mind.

00:24:05.480 --> 00:24:09.480
This is current Maitri's friendliness

00:24:09.480 --> 00:24:13.280
is resting on something
in the past. It has to be.

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:17.180
All results are resting
on causes in the past.

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:21.060
We call it dependent origination.

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:24.860
This is current state of mind is resting

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:26.471
on some state of mind in the past.

00:24:26.471 --> 00:24:27.646
RTEN YIN PA DE'I PHYIR,

00:24:27.646 --> 00:24:29.360
YID BLO RTOG PA RTEN MED PA MA YIN NO

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:34.360
Therefore, it is not the case
that Maitri's personality

00:24:35.000 --> 00:24:37.460
came out of no place, came from nowhere.

00:24:37.460 --> 00:24:40.490
It is not the case that
one of Veronica's children

00:24:40.490 --> 00:24:43.690
was crying all the time and
the other child was happy

00:24:43.690 --> 00:24:46.830
all the time. It is not the
case that there is no cause

00:24:46.830 --> 00:24:49.380
for that. There must be a cause for that.

00:24:49.380 --> 00:24:52.813
It must have happened before they came out

00:24:52.813 --> 00:24:55.090
because it came out that way.

00:24:55.090 --> 00:24:59.840
The cause must be, the fire
must be under the smoke.

00:24:59.840 --> 00:25:02.455
We can see the smoke,
which is the personality

00:25:02.455 --> 00:25:06.113
of the newborn child, but
we can not see the fire,

00:25:06.113 --> 00:25:09.250
but we can make some
assumptions about the fire.

00:25:09.250 --> 00:25:11.830
We can try to use our logic to say,

00:25:11.830 --> 00:25:14.373
there must have been something
before they came out.

00:25:17.500 --> 00:25:19.667
I think I have a picture here.

00:25:21.562 --> 00:25:24.260
This is silverware, I don'y know,

00:25:24.260 --> 00:25:26.050
my mind is on tables and silverware,

00:25:26.050 --> 00:25:29.125
because I am trying to get a cafe open.

00:25:29.125 --> 00:25:34.125
Look, can you see the table,
which is holding up the dishes,

00:25:34.833 --> 00:25:38.460
and the silverware and the glasses?

00:25:38.460 --> 00:25:39.740
Can you see the table?

00:25:39.740 --> 00:25:40.580
Yes or no?

00:25:40.580 --> 00:25:44.177
The wooden table? You can not see.

00:25:44.177 --> 00:25:47.420
You can see something is
holding up the glasses,

00:25:47.420 --> 00:25:50.536
and the dishes and the silverware,

00:25:50.536 --> 00:25:52.572
but it is covered with a cloth, right?

00:25:52.572 --> 00:25:56.590
And you can not see it. That
cloth is the moment of birth.

00:25:56.590 --> 00:26:01.340
The silverware and the dishes
is Maitri's friendly nature.

00:26:01.340 --> 00:26:06.100
And Buddhism says, there must
be something behind the cloth.

00:26:06.100 --> 00:26:11.100
If you look into the
darkness of the few hours

00:26:11.100 --> 00:26:14.740
before Maitri was born,
is there something there?

00:26:14.740 --> 00:26:16.720
Or before he was conceived?

00:26:16.720 --> 00:26:19.700
Is there something there upon which

00:26:19.700 --> 00:26:21.710
his friendliness is resting?

00:26:21.710 --> 00:26:25.340
And shouldn't it be of the same type?

00:26:25.340 --> 00:26:29.340
Being angry does not make
you friendly an hour later.

00:26:29.340 --> 00:26:30.880
Being an angry person does not make you

00:26:30.880 --> 00:26:34.030
a friendly person the next
year. Being a friendly person

00:26:34.030 --> 00:26:36.250
makes you a friendly person the next year.

00:26:36.250 --> 00:26:39.982
YID BLO LAS DBANG PO
RNAMS 'BYUNG BA YIN TE

00:26:39.982 --> 00:26:43.103
That sense powers have come from the mind,

00:26:43.103 --> 00:26:45.369
YID BLO SNGA MA 'GA'
ZHIG DBANG PO RNAMS KYI

00:26:45.369 --> 00:26:47.736
'PHEN BYED KYI RGYU YIN PA DE'I PHYIR,

00:26:47.736 --> 00:26:49.780
because according to Buddhism,

00:26:49.780 --> 00:26:53.203
it was your consciousness
of your past life,

00:26:54.490 --> 00:26:58.230
affected by mental
seeds, that has projected

00:26:58.230 --> 00:27:01.570
your sense powers, your eyes, your ears,

00:27:01.570 --> 00:27:04.419
your nose, into this life.

00:27:04.419 --> 00:27:07.920
Maitri's friendliness did
not come from his skin.

00:27:07.920 --> 00:27:12.919
His skin came from his friendliness.

00:27:15.010 --> 00:27:18.343
Now Dharmakirti is like turning it around.

00:27:19.310 --> 00:27:21.570
Again, I told you Maitri's state of mind

00:27:21.570 --> 00:27:24.310
did not come from skin,
from his chemicals.

00:27:24.310 --> 00:27:27.040
Okay, I got that. But you know what?

00:27:27.040 --> 00:27:29.990
His chemicals did come from
his state of mind. Why?

00:27:29.990 --> 00:27:31.963
Because they came from
the karma in his mind.

00:27:31.963 --> 00:27:35.021
PHYIS 'CHI KHA'I SEMS SOGS
KYANG SNGA MA DANG 'DRA BAR

00:27:35.021 --> 00:27:37.580
RIGS 'DRA PHYI MA MTSAMS
SBYOR BA 'GYUR BA YIN TE

00:27:37.580 --> 00:27:40.790
According to the state
of the mind as you die,

00:27:40.790 --> 00:27:44.414
strongly affects the state of
the mind when you come out.

00:27:44.414 --> 00:27:46.472
RIGS 'DRA DE 'DRA'I 'PHEN BYED KYI

00:27:46.472 --> 00:27:47.690
RGYU YOD PAR GYUR PA'I PHYIR

00:27:47.690 --> 00:27:52.200
There must be a cause
similar to friendliness

00:27:52.200 --> 00:27:55.962
that existed in the mind in the past.

00:27:55.962 --> 00:28:00.330
RTZA 'GREL DE DAG NI

00:28:00.330 --> 00:28:05.330
I think, I can say, we
have finished Dharmakirti.

00:28:05.660 --> 00:28:08.080
We finished covering his verses.

00:28:08.080 --> 00:28:11.730
Basically, what he is trying to say is

00:28:11.730 --> 00:28:15.100
Maitri did not get his
friendliness from chemicals.

00:28:15.100 --> 00:28:19.290
In fact, it seems to be proof,
there seems like there could

00:28:19.290 --> 00:28:23.680
be some proof that his physical
body came from his karma,

00:28:23.680 --> 00:28:25.653
from his mind.

00:28:27.090 --> 00:28:32.090
And now, Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk begins

00:28:32.283 --> 00:28:35.440
to interpret Dharmakirti for us.

00:28:35.440 --> 00:28:38.210
That is what is so cool
about Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk.

00:28:38.210 --> 00:28:40.960
First, he tells you the
meaning of the words.

00:28:40.960 --> 00:28:43.560
Then, he stops and he says, "Now, okay,

00:28:43.560 --> 00:28:46.360
we covered the words. Now you
know what the verses mean.

00:28:47.320 --> 00:28:48.850
But what does it mean for us?"

00:28:48.850 --> 00:28:51.950
That is Geshe Yeshe
Wangchuk. That is his style.

00:28:51.950 --> 00:28:53.303
What does it mean for us?

00:28:54.160 --> 00:28:57.484
Then he says, RTZA 'GREL DE
DAG NI, SKYE BA SNGA PHYI

00:28:57.484 --> 00:28:59.867
YOD PAR SGRUB PA'I RIGS PA BSTAN PA STE

00:29:01.330 --> 00:29:06.330
The whole point of these
verses is to explain to us

00:29:07.512 --> 00:29:11.660
that we did have a past life. That's all.

00:29:11.660 --> 00:29:15.240
All this argument about
Maitri's personality,

00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:18.660
and this argument about
Maitri's state of mind,

00:29:18.660 --> 00:29:21.820
and this argument about his sense powers,

00:29:21.820 --> 00:29:25.810
it all ties back to, is there a past life?

00:29:25.810 --> 00:29:28.377
Did you have a past life or not?

00:29:28.377 --> 00:29:30.993
BYIS PA SKYES MA THAG PA'I
DBUGS 'BYUNG RNGUB SOGS RANG GI

00:29:30.993 --> 00:29:33.519
RIGS 'DRA SNGA MA LAS BYUNG BA SGRUB NAS

00:29:33.519 --> 00:29:36.060
This is now Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk talking.

00:29:36.060 --> 00:29:40.240
Dharmakirti has demonstrated
that the living-ness,

00:29:40.240 --> 00:29:44.200
the life, the breathing-ness of Maitri,

00:29:44.200 --> 00:29:46.700
has come from some earlier
cause which is similar.

00:29:46.700 --> 00:29:49.000
Life comes from life.

00:29:49.000 --> 00:29:51.909
SGRUB NAS RIGS 'DRA SNGA
MA DE SKYE BA SNGA MA'I

00:29:51.909 --> 00:29:54.752
DBUGS 'BYUNG RNGUB SOGS YIN PAR SHES

00:29:54.752 --> 00:29:58.700
He wants you to understand
that the life energy

00:29:58.700 --> 00:30:02.240
you see reflected in Maitri's breathing,

00:30:02.240 --> 00:30:07.240
is an indication, like smoke
is an indication of fire,

00:30:07.270 --> 00:30:11.410
that Maitri's living-breathing
is an indication

00:30:11.410 --> 00:30:15.250
of a former living-breathing,
meaning past life.

00:30:15.250 --> 00:30:17.948
That is Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk.

00:30:19.640 --> 00:30:20.740
Fish picture.

00:30:24.870 --> 00:30:27.590
Now, what does that have to do
with different color fishes?

00:30:27.590 --> 00:30:29.540
I am getting there.

00:30:30.707 --> 00:30:33.007
DA LTA'I SKYES MA THAG
PA'I DBANG SOGS RNAMS

00:30:33.007 --> 00:30:34.730
'BYUNG BA 'BA' ZHIG LAS BYUNG NA

00:30:34.730 --> 00:30:37.630
Now this is Geshe Yeshe
Wangchuk trying to make

00:30:37.630 --> 00:30:39.600
Dharmakiti more clear to us.

00:30:39.600 --> 00:30:44.063
Look, even if your eye powers:

00:30:45.090 --> 00:30:49.570
your ears, eyes, ears, nose, tongue, skin,

00:30:49.570 --> 00:30:54.570
even if they did come
from elements, chemicals,

00:30:55.100 --> 00:30:57.380
let us say they came from chemicals.

00:30:57.380 --> 00:31:01.450
Then if you have a sink
full of the same chemicals

00:31:01.450 --> 00:31:05.898
why do you get different
kinds of beings popping up?

00:31:05.898 --> 00:31:10.898
If the body came only from chemicals,

00:31:12.050 --> 00:31:15.380
then if you put the same
chemicals in a pond,

00:31:15.380 --> 00:31:18.200
you should get the same
creatures coming out

00:31:18.200 --> 00:31:20.874
of those chemicals. But,

00:31:20.874 --> 00:31:24.180
CHU GCIG GI NANG DU
'BU MGO DMAR LUS SER BA

00:31:24.180 --> 00:31:29.172
But you see in some ponds
there are fish with red heads,

00:31:30.150 --> 00:31:33.420
and yellow bodies. And
then you see other fish

00:31:33.420 --> 00:31:36.590
with yellow heads and red bodies. Why?

00:31:36.590 --> 00:31:40.020
If it is the same chemicals,
if it is the same chemicals,

00:31:40.020 --> 00:31:42.163
why is there variation in the result?

00:31:43.066 --> 00:31:46.110
SROG CHAGS 'GA' ZHIG
CHUNG LA 'GA' ZHIG CHE BA

00:31:46.110 --> 00:31:47.900
Some of the creatures in the pond are big.

00:31:47.900 --> 00:31:49.730
Some of the creatures
in the pond are small.

00:31:49.730 --> 00:31:52.280
MI LA'ANG 'GA' ZHIG LUS
CHE LA 'GA' ZHIG CHUNG BA

00:31:52.280 --> 00:31:54.790
Even among humans, you
get some with big bodies

00:31:54.790 --> 00:31:56.345
and someone with small bodies.

00:31:56.345 --> 00:32:00.030
RES 'GA' BLO GROS RNO LA RES 'GA' BRTUL PA

00:32:00.030 --> 00:32:03.400
You see different people
popping out from the same

00:32:03.400 --> 00:32:08.400
general chemical batch, from
the same general chemicals.

00:32:09.100 --> 00:32:12.250
You get some people popping
up who are very smart,

00:32:12.250 --> 00:32:15.960
and you get other people
popping up that are very stupid.

00:32:15.960 --> 00:32:20.269
That indicates that it might
not be just the chemicals.

00:32:20.269 --> 00:32:23.043
YANG PHRU GU 'GA' ZHIG
SHES RAB DANG BRTZE BA SOGS

00:32:23.043 --> 00:32:25.775
CHE LA 'GA' ZHIG CHAGS
SOGS NYON MONG SHAS CHE BA

00:32:25.775 --> 00:32:28.091
YOD PA SOGS MI 'THAD PAR 'GYUR TE

00:32:28.091 --> 00:32:31.150
That must be incorrect
because also we see some kids,

00:32:31.150 --> 00:32:35.380
young, young kids, some
are naturally gifted

00:32:35.380 --> 00:32:40.380
with intelligence and
with love - BRTZE BA.

00:32:40.689 --> 00:32:43.610
You have seen kids who come
up to you, you give them

00:32:43.610 --> 00:32:46.586
a piece of candy and they
want to give back to you.

00:32:46.586 --> 00:32:49.310
It always amazes me these kind of kids.

00:32:49.310 --> 00:32:53.139
Wow, they did something I wouldn't do.

00:32:54.360 --> 00:32:57.920
And then, CHAGS SOGS NYON
MONG, then you see other kids

00:32:57.920 --> 00:32:59.760
who are very possessive of their toys,

00:32:59.760 --> 00:33:02.370
you try to get them to share
a toy with somebody else

00:33:02.370 --> 00:33:05.720
and they start getting angry and fighting.

00:33:05.720 --> 00:33:10.720
So he says, this is an
indication that those kids minds,

00:33:11.250 --> 00:33:14.620
personalities, sense powers are not just

00:33:14.620 --> 00:33:17.940
coming from the chemicals in the womb.

00:33:17.940 --> 00:33:21.220
If they were just coming from
the chemicals in the womb,

00:33:21.220 --> 00:33:24.650
there should not be such
a variation of results

00:33:24.650 --> 00:33:26.930
from the same batch of chemicals,

00:33:26.930 --> 00:33:28.522
from the same pool of chemicals

00:33:28.522 --> 00:33:31.571
you should get similar people.

00:33:31.571 --> 00:33:33.262
RANG GI RIGS 'DRA SNGA
MA LA BLTOS MI DGOS PAR

00:33:33.262 --> 00:33:35.130
'BYUNG BA TZAM LAS SKYE BA'I PHYIR

00:33:35.130 --> 00:33:39.000
If they just grew from chemicals,

00:33:39.000 --> 00:33:41.670
then their personality would not depend on

00:33:41.670 --> 00:33:44.780
a past personality from a past life.

00:33:44.780 --> 00:33:47.570
If they just grew from
chemicals, then since people

00:33:47.570 --> 00:33:49.890
are growing from the
same kinds of chemicals,

00:33:49.890 --> 00:33:53.247
they should be similar. They
should not be different.

00:33:53.247 --> 00:33:56.547
YANG SROG CHAGS RNAMS 'BYUNG
BA 'BA' ZHIG LAS SKYES NA,

00:33:56.547 --> 00:33:58.855
'BYUNG BA GCIG SROG CHAGS SU 'GYUR BA NA,

00:33:58.855 --> 00:34:00.721
'BYUNG BA KUN SROG CHAGS SU 'GYUR BAR THAL

00:34:00.721 --> 00:34:03.250
Then I will give you another argument.

00:34:03.250 --> 00:34:05.517
Who is talking?

00:34:05.517 --> 00:34:06.730
Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk.

00:34:06.730 --> 00:34:09.730
He is trying to explain Dharmakirti to us.

00:34:09.730 --> 00:34:12.488
He said, "Look, I finished the
root text, I taught you all

00:34:12.488 --> 00:34:15.436
the words. Here is what
he is really saying."

00:34:15.436 --> 00:34:18.795
SROG CHAGS RNAMS 'BYUNG
BA 'BA' ZHIG LAS SKYES NA

00:34:18.795 --> 00:34:23.764
If living beings, if life was
created only from chemicals,

00:34:25.501 --> 00:34:27.730
'BYUNG BA GCIG SROG CHAGS SU 'GYUR BA NA

00:34:27.730 --> 00:34:31.321
then if one batch of
chemicals became a person,

00:34:31.321 --> 00:34:34.260
'BYUNG BA KUN SROG CHAGS SU 'GYUR BAR THAL

00:34:34.260 --> 00:34:36.320
then every time you have those chemicals,

00:34:36.320 --> 00:34:39.520
there should be a Maitri.
Poof! Maitri comes. Why?

00:34:39.520 --> 00:34:41.592
Well, there is nitrogen. There is oxygen.

00:34:41.592 --> 00:34:46.592
There should be life wherever
those chemicals are present,

00:34:46.660 --> 00:34:50.643
if it was only the chemicals
that created the life.

00:34:50.643 --> 00:34:51.476
CHAGS SU 'GYUR BAR THAL,

00:34:51.476 --> 00:34:54.892
'GYUR MI 'GYUR GYI RGYU RKYEN
GANG YANG MED PA'I PHYIR

00:34:55.920 --> 00:35:00.140
Because what things are
and what things are not

00:35:00.140 --> 00:35:04.203
follows from their causes
and their conditions.

00:35:04.203 --> 00:35:05.511
RANG LUGS NI

00:35:05.511 --> 00:35:06.805
What does it mean Tim?, RANG LUGS?

00:35:08.810 --> 00:35:11.360
RANG LUGS

00:35:11.360 --> 00:35:13.360
Come on, RANG LUGS.

00:35:14.210 --> 00:35:15.812
Yes, Us guys.

00:35:15.812 --> 00:35:18.345
Now Geshe Yeshe Wangchuk says,

00:35:18.345 --> 00:35:20.795
"Hey, do I have you confused yet?"

00:35:20.795 --> 00:35:21.990
- Yeah.

00:35:21.990 --> 00:35:23.270
- Did you learn anything?

00:35:23.270 --> 00:35:24.560
- Yeah, I think so.

00:35:24.560 --> 00:35:25.729
- What did you learn?

00:35:25.729 --> 00:35:28.320
- Maitri's personality did
not come from the chemicals

00:35:28.320 --> 00:35:30.150
in Noor's womb.

00:35:30.150 --> 00:35:33.450
- Okay, good. Well, okay, I understand.

00:35:33.450 --> 00:35:35.940
- Where do you think his
personality came from?

00:35:35.940 --> 00:35:39.360
Now, he says, "You want me to tell you?

00:35:39.360 --> 00:35:41.270
You want to know my opinion where

00:35:41.270 --> 00:35:43.244
Maitri's personality came from?"

00:35:43.244 --> 00:35:45.618
YID BLO RTOG PA SNGA MA
'GA' ZHIG 'PHEN BYED KYI

00:35:45.618 --> 00:35:49.093
RGYU BYED PA LAS DA LTAR
RNAM SMIN GYIS BSDUS PA'I

00:35:49.093 --> 00:35:50.560
DBANG PO SOGS BYUNG LA

00:35:50.560 --> 00:35:53.730
Maitri's personality and his sense powers

00:35:53.730 --> 00:35:58.150
have come from karma, karmic
seeds, that were collected

00:35:58.150 --> 00:36:01.540
in his mind, previously, in his past life.

00:36:01.540 --> 00:36:03.993
Those are creating his
current personality.

00:36:04.875 --> 00:36:08.410
'CHI KHA'I YID BLO RTOG PA
'GA' ZHIG GIS RGYU BYED PA LAS

00:36:08.410 --> 00:36:11.770
And in particular, the
particular thoughts that

00:36:11.770 --> 00:36:15.023
he was entertaining as he died,

00:36:15.023 --> 00:36:17.878
'CHI KHA means in the moment of his death.

00:36:17.878 --> 00:36:19.894
YID BLO RTOG PA 'GA'
ZHIG GIS RGYU BYED PA LAS

00:36:19.894 --> 00:36:23.152
PHYI MA'I DBANG SOGS
KYANG 'BYUNG BAR 'GYUR BAS

00:36:25.640 --> 00:36:29.945
The seeds of the mind at the
moment of this past life,

00:36:29.945 --> 00:36:34.703
death, that had the NUS PA, had the power

00:36:34.703 --> 00:36:37.984
to create his current personality.

00:36:37.984 --> 00:36:40.287
Those seeds in his mind are what

00:36:40.287 --> 00:36:42.462
created his current personality.

00:36:42.462 --> 00:36:45.316
We are continuing.

00:36:45.316 --> 00:36:48.983
By the way, do you have a
picture of me and a wall?

00:36:50.415 --> 00:36:52.965
So now, Geshe Yeshe wants you to...

00:36:52.965 --> 00:36:55.656
Hmm, the one before that, I hope.

00:36:56.999 --> 00:36:59.050
Hmm, the picture before that,

00:36:59.050 --> 00:37:01.760
unless I got. Hmm.

00:37:01.760 --> 00:37:04.288
Why are you crying, Maitri? Is that you?

00:37:04.288 --> 00:37:05.721
How about the one before that?

00:37:05.721 --> 00:37:06.554
(laughing

00:37:06.554 --> 00:37:07.410
- [Student] Still fish.

00:37:07.410 --> 00:37:08.693
- Do you have a picture of a wall

00:37:08.693 --> 00:37:10.518
and kids painting on a wall?

00:37:10.518 --> 00:37:11.351
[Student] No.

00:37:11.351 --> 00:37:14.227
I guess I left it out, okay.

00:37:14.227 --> 00:37:16.290
Ah, do not worry about it, okay.

00:37:16.290 --> 00:37:17.123
Let's see the commentary.

00:37:17.123 --> 00:37:19.439
DE'I PHYIR, DBANG PO LNGA
RE RE LA GNOD NA YID BLO

00:37:19.439 --> 00:37:21.647
'GYUR BAS KHYAB PA MED LA

00:37:23.430 --> 00:37:27.630
If you think about it, you
can damage the sense power,

00:37:27.630 --> 00:37:30.290
but that does not damage the mind.

00:37:30.290 --> 00:37:32.789
You can have a happy person.

00:37:32.789 --> 00:37:36.460
I met a lady like that in
Taiwan. She came to me,

00:37:36.460 --> 00:37:40.510
very big business lady. Her
daughter brought me to her,

00:37:40.510 --> 00:37:42.910
and she said that something happened.

00:37:42.910 --> 00:37:45.190
First she told me how rich her mom is

00:37:45.190 --> 00:37:46.820
and how successful her mom is.

00:37:46.820 --> 00:37:49.348
And I am like, "Wow, that's cool."

00:37:49.348 --> 00:37:50.870
Then she said, "Well, something happened."

00:37:50.870 --> 00:37:52.067
And I said, "What?"

00:37:52.067 --> 00:37:55.250
I do not know, I think she
was getting cosmetic surgery,

00:37:55.250 --> 00:37:59.430
and they cut her optic
nerve, and she is blind.

00:37:59.430 --> 00:38:01.660
They cut the nerve in
her eye and she is blind.

00:38:01.660 --> 00:38:03.040
She got blind because she did not want to

00:38:03.040 --> 00:38:04.100
have wrinkles or something.

00:38:04.100 --> 00:38:06.800
Now she is blind, completely blind.

00:38:06.800 --> 00:38:09.123
So you can hurt the sense power,

00:38:10.150 --> 00:38:12.940
but that does not necessarily
make the person upset.

00:38:12.940 --> 00:38:16.230
She was quite calm and
she was quite lucid,

00:38:16.230 --> 00:38:17.468
and she was ready to keep working.

00:38:17.468 --> 00:38:22.270
It is possible to damage the sense power.

00:38:22.270 --> 00:38:27.270
It is possible to damage
the chemicals in the skin,

00:38:28.620 --> 00:38:32.413
but not damage the
personality. It is possible.

00:38:32.413 --> 00:38:33.246
KHYAB PA MED LA

00:38:33.246 --> 00:38:36.479
YID BLO LA MYA NGAN DANG
'BYUNG PO SOGS KYIS 'GYUR NA

00:38:36.479 --> 00:38:38.687
DBANG PO LA GNOD PAS KHYAB PA'I PHYIR

00:38:38.687 --> 00:38:42.830
But if some kind of
influence of depression,

00:38:42.830 --> 00:38:47.060
or you can say grief at
the loss of a loved one,

00:38:47.060 --> 00:38:51.030
affects the mind strongly.
That does have an effect

00:38:51.030 --> 00:38:53.823
on the chemicals of the
body. The person gets older.

00:38:54.900 --> 00:38:56.975
The person gains weight or

00:38:56.975 --> 00:39:00.380
things happen to depressed people.

00:39:00.380 --> 00:39:01.213
All right.

00:39:01.213 --> 00:39:04.578
So now you can show my chandelier, Pachi.

00:39:07.270 --> 00:39:12.270
Generally, we have this feeling that...

00:39:12.360 --> 00:39:15.710
and by the way, it took me a
long time to get this picture.

00:39:15.710 --> 00:39:17.500
Understand this.

00:39:17.500 --> 00:39:22.500
Generally, we say that this
is the past-life condition,

00:39:23.130 --> 00:39:25.700
and this is the present-life condition.

00:39:25.700 --> 00:39:27.760
The present-life condition is resting

00:39:27.760 --> 00:39:30.080
on the past-life condition, right?

00:39:30.080 --> 00:39:34.827
But it seems like to scientists

00:39:36.112 --> 00:39:41.010
that Maitri's personality
is resting on chemicals

00:39:41.010 --> 00:39:43.610
that were in his mom.

00:39:43.610 --> 00:39:46.990
Maitri's mind is made from chemicals that

00:39:46.990 --> 00:39:49.770
were in the soup inside his mom.

00:39:49.770 --> 00:39:53.278
So it looks like his mind
is resting on the chemicals.

00:39:53.278 --> 00:39:55.361
But with this chandelier,

00:39:59.136 --> 00:40:00.969
it is not always the case

00:40:00.969 --> 00:40:05.363
that the thing on top is what
is resting on the other thing.

00:40:07.435 --> 00:40:09.823
The chandelier is resting on the ceiling.

00:40:10.660 --> 00:40:12.920
The ceiling is holding up the chandelier.

00:40:12.920 --> 00:40:14.895
It is not that the thing on the bottom

00:40:14.895 --> 00:40:17.390
is always the support,

00:40:17.390 --> 00:40:20.550
and the thing on top is always

00:40:20.550 --> 00:40:22.670
what is being supported. Sometimes,

00:40:22.670 --> 00:40:25.340
when you have a chandelier
hanging from the roof,

00:40:25.340 --> 00:40:29.738
the roof is on top, but it
is holding up the chandelier.

00:40:30.945 --> 00:40:34.530
So Maitri's personality did not come

00:40:34.530 --> 00:40:38.770
from the chemicals in his mom's womb.

00:40:38.770 --> 00:40:42.520
Maybe it is the opposite.
What's the opposite?

00:40:42.520 --> 00:40:46.510
His personality created his mom's womb.

00:40:46.510 --> 00:40:49.520
His personality created the
chemicals in his mom's womb.

00:40:49.520 --> 00:40:51.122
