00:40:51.122 --> 00:40:55.964
DPER NA, YID LA 'JIGS SKRAG
SHUGS DRAG PA'I DUS NA,

00:40:55.964 --> 00:40:58.680
LCE DBANG GIS RO ZHIM
PO MI MYONG BA BZHIN NO

