The loss of the eye was only a factor,

00:42:55.823 --> 00:42:58.073
RKYEN, not the main cause.

00:42:59.058 --> 00:43:03.041
YID LA MYA NGAN GZHAN ZHIG
BYUNG MYA NGAN DE JE RGYAS

00:43:03.041 --> 00:43:06.032
SU SONG BAS YID BLO YANG
'GYUR BA YIN PA'I PHYIR,

00:43:08.970 --> 00:43:13.460
